Jenkins Attune Pack
Copyright 2026 Attune

This product adapts concepts and behavior from the StackStorm Exchange Jenkins
pack, version 1.0.1, revision
884692248ce19ae3220e88b5f4f5d446394e683a, originally authored by James Fryman
with contributions from Igor Cherkaev and StackStorm Exchange contributors.
That work is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The implementation has been substantially changed for Attune: direct Jenkins
HTTP API access replaces StackStorm and python-jenkins runners; credentials are
resolved from Attune Key; TLS, CSRF, response limits, path encoding, polling,
confirmation, XML, and artifact controls were added; outputs and action
metadata were redesigned.

